---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftDonationBundle
---
Construct a DonationBundle draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Assemble useful combinations rather than allocating isolated items that cannot serve the recipient’s purpose. Propose acceptable substitutions, identify missing components, and ensure the bundle’s condition and practical requirements match the confirmed need.
